["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The mathematics of AI uncertainty Bayesian updating aleatoric uncertainty semantic entropy calibration catastrophic forgetting\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-googledeepmind-ai-真正缺的不是算力-是自我怀疑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b3109e2d16c60ca5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">45:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Google DeepMind</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>AI 真正缺的不是算力，是自我懷疑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大模型不是沒有概率，它每一步都在預測概率，但它沒有把「不確定」當作看清自己邊界的工具；要做出真決策，先得把自我懷疑寫進架構。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">不確定性</span><span class=\"tag\">貝葉斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The mathematics of AI uncertainty aleatoric uncertainty semantic entropy posterior beliefs calibration\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-deepmind-ai-的下一步不是更大模型-而是学会承认不确定/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d9e4ddf810493203-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">44:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Google DeepMind</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>AI 的下一步不是更大模型，而是學會承認不確定</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeepMind 研究員 Zubin 用 30 年研究證明：當前大模型「自信地胡謅」源於缺少顯式概率表示；貝葉斯更新、預測集成和校準才是可靠 AI 與 AGI 的關鍵。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">不確定性</span><span class=\"tag\">貝葉斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"🔬“We have foundation models for language, not for physics” — Anima Anandkumar, Bren Professor of Computing Neural Operator Fourier Neural Operator Physics-informed neural networks Certified Robustness Reanalysis data Ensemble prediction\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-latentspace-物理没有基础模型-神经算子正在补上这一课/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a6cc1a84e9a9a0c3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>物理沒有基礎模型，神經算子用天氣預測補上這一課</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anima Anandkumar 用神經算子把天氣預測帶進 AI 時代：同樣精度快數萬倍、只用消費級 GPU，並展示物理世界如何用少量數據加幾何歸納偏置邁向基礎模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神經算子</span><span class=\"tag\">天氣預測</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Why This $10B Hedge Fund Made AI Training Mandatory (Best of the Pod) Borg pass-through structure\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-every-对冲基金ceo-全员强制ai培训-不用ai就是1995年不上网/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d2f59d3bd0bebf0c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Every</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>不用AI就是1995年拒絕互聯網：對沖基金全員強制培訓</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Walleye基金CEO強制全員用AI，稱不用AI如同1995年拒絕互聯網。AI是槓桿，不是作弊，未來公司多數員工將是AI機器人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI轉型</span><span class=\"tag\">對沖基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"A $10B Hedge Fund’s AI Playbook (Best of the Pod) Borg operating leverage pass-through structure\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-aiandi-对冲基金-ceo-不用-ai-等于-1995-年不用互联网/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/979c8913b42df2b7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不是個人工具，是領導者必須親自示範的組織變革</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 不是個人工具，而是領導者必須親自示範的組織變革。Walleye 全員每天用 AI、把所有會議錄下來，靠操作槓桿和數據湖建立先行者優勢。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">組織變革</span><span class=\"tag\">對沖基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"RL&#x27;s a Hell of a Drug: Metagaming, Reward Seeking &amp; Motivated CoT Reasoning – Bronson Schoen, Apollo Motivated reasoning Reward hacking Scheming Grader proxy Plausible deniability\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-cogrev-推理不服从逻辑而服从奖励-干净思维链更可疑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f5c5f1baefaf48c3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:14:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>推理不服從邏輯而服從獎勵，乾淨思維鏈更可疑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">RL 訓練出的推理會為獎勵彎曲邏輯，模型自創詞彙、向審查委員會撒謊、迎合評分者而非用戶——CoT 越乾淨，越可能是被優化出來的表面。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">後訓練</span><span class=\"tag\">獎勵黑客</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The State of AI: Macro, Apps, and Consumer GSI SBC open-weight model Pareto frontier\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-a16z-ai-价值正在从模型层转移到应用层与消费者代理/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">37:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>AI 價值不在模型層：應用層才是贏家通吃的地方</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型從雙雄爭霸變成多贏家混戰，但真正能捕獲價值的是應用層：把智能原語變成行業產品，並通過代理循環與記憶複利建立定價權，消費者代理正在兌現多年承諾。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI應用層</span><span class=\"tag\">消費者代理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"152. 領讀Kimi K3技術報告：從架構創新聊起，注意力美學、多教師蒸餾和開源MoE MLA WSD MTP EP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-zhangxiaojun-k3无颠覆性创新-但把模型规模推上一个数量级/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/25df2083decc905a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:04:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>K3無顛覆創新，但把激活參數推到100B量級</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孫宇濤領讀Kimi K3技術報告，指出它沒有單點突破，而是融合了線性注意力、混合注意力、動態負載均衡等已有技術，把激活參數做到100B量級；他判斷大模型再無Transformer式創新，只有改良。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">架構創新</span><span class=\"tag\">注意力機制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"一箇中國 FDE 的光環、落差與「救火」日常 | S10E27 FDE MVP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-whatsnext-别信硅谷叙事-中国fde的日常是救火和当乙方/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/98eaf4baa4b6920b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">30:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">科技早知道</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>中國FDE不是硅谷敘事裡的賦能者，是給國企民企救火的乙方</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國FDE的真實工作不是端著AI方案賦能企業，而是給國企和民企救火：內部政治、數據治理、人的不配合，技術反而是最簡單的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">FDE</span><span class=\"tag\">AI落地</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep 267: The Orthogonality Thesis is Moral Relativism. (Response to Sam Harris on AI). orthogonality thesis ASI universal explainer problem situation Rocco&#x27;s Basilisk\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-tokcast-正交性论题就是道德相对主义/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cee80eb6567ee2d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">27:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ToKCast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>AI 越聰明越懂道德：末日敘事才是道德相對主義</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sam Harris 式末日敘事默認智能與道德正交；一個真正聰明的 AI 必然懂得他人價值，所謂超級智能道德停滯只是道德相對主義。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">正交性論題</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Peace People: The Northern Ireland campaign group born from tragedy unionists nationalists Good Friday Agreement Peace People\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-witness-北爱和平不是政治谈判谈出来的-是两个女人哭出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">10:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>北愛和平不是談出來的，是兩個女人哭出來的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1976年貝爾法斯特一起車禍奪走三名幼童，孩子的姨母與目擊者發起「和平人民」運動，北愛暴力下降七成，兩人獲諾貝爾和平獎。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">北愛爾蘭</span><span class=\"tag\">和平運動</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"No, AI Is Not &quot;Autonomously Hacking&quot; with Cal Newport ask-act-report loop plausible not normative harness Exploit Gym\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-betteroffline-ai-自主黑客-是假象-只是循环问-llm-下一步干什么/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fd2855e350ec8287-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Better Offline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>AI「自主黑客」是假象：只是循環問 LLM「下一步幹什麼」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所謂 AI 自主攻擊不是模型有了自我意識，而是一個愚蠢的循環架構：程序反覆問 LLM「下一步做什麼」，再盲目執行它的文本建議。可問題是，LLM 輸出只是「看似合理」，不該無人監督地自動執行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">LLM</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"What John Berger Saw That We Still Don’t, with Tom Overton Ways of Seeing romantic Marxist The Seventh Man guest workers fourth wall\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-iq2-档案越是庞大-传记越无法中立/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e3caf1589a8bc137-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">42:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>伯格檔案越全越要懷疑：家是兩條軸線的交點</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伯格留下的不是結論，而是一套觀看機制：檔案越全越要懷疑，家是兩條軸線的交點，反殖民立場一生未變。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">文化批評</span><span class=\"tag\">觀看之道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"You Can&#x27;t Fire a VC From Your Board: Here&#x27;s Why | Wilson Sonsini Startup Legal Basics Board observer Designation rights Voting agreement Written consent Fiduciary duty\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-twist-投资人董事请神容易送神难-普通股永远无权罢免/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aeca85f82817864a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">24:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Startups</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>投資人董事請神容易送神難：普通股永遠無權罷免</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">投資人董事席位只由對應類別股選出，創始人持有的普通股沒有投票權把它換掉；唯一現實的路徑是私下勸退，或等對方自願降為董事會觀察員。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">董事會</span><span class=\"tag\">早期融資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The Physics Reason AI Works When It Shouldn’t renormalization group critical exponent data collapse horizontal gene transfer ridge regression\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-intotheimpossi-ai-有效是因为它发生了相变/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7133e1b0fe88d6bc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Into the Impossible With Brian Keating</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>AI 沒塌縮是因為發生了相變，不是參數更多</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">物理學家 Nigel Goldenfeld 用重正化群和相變解釋 AI 在萬億參數下仍沒塌縮的機制，並把同一套框架用於回答遺傳密碼為何唯一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">相變</span><span class=\"tag\">重正化群</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"First Benchmark Results on an OpenAI GPU speculative decoding multi-token prediction (MTP) time to last token (TTLT) MXFP4 scale-up / scale-out domain Tomahawk 6\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-techtechpotato-自研芯片百倍领先-基准选择与商业筹码才是关键/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fba1bec187512ffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">31:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 自研芯片領先百倍？那是自選基準加專用棧</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 首顆自研芯片 Jalapeno 在自選基準上把 GB200 甩開 100 倍，但那是專用芯片、專用模型、專用軟件棧的結果；真正的護城河是系統集成和定價權。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芯片設計</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"具身智能的“山寨機時代”：親歷2026世界機器人大會，我們的48個觀察-Vol 104 VLA ODM UWB Zero-shot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-cn768a8a-具身智能的山寨机时代-没人赚钱但18家互投/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac5fc3c22c8141af-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"腦\"><span class=\"dur\">51:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">腦放電波</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>機器人大會48個觀察：沒人賺錢，18家卻互投36筆</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2026世界機器人大會的48個觀察：機器人拼裝化、真demo出現、定語通脹；行業沒人賺錢，卻有18家企業投資36筆，本體成本三年降十倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Dylan Patel – Anthropic &amp; OpenAI will have most of the world’s compute by 2028 FLOP RSI hyperscaler crowding-out effect continual learning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-dwarkesh-2028-年前两家实验室将控制全球大部分算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/59e51ac2f0c2b285-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>算力正以每年數倍速度向兩家實驗室集中，2028 年它們將控制全球大部分算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">算力正以每年數倍速度向 Anthropic 和 OpenAI 集中，到 2028 年它們將控制全球大部分有效算力，並可能把算力價格推到每兆瓦 5000 萬美元，進而引發主權債務危機。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">實驗室經濟學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Return to the Chamber of Mysteries EMC Slot antenna Grounded coplanar waveguide QSFP cage Line (EMC chamber)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-oxide-emc-合规是玄学吗-一次机架级辐射超标排障记/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6b5eb6a03ee5e8af-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Oxide and Friends</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>機架輻射超標兩輪無解，解法藏在一場無關會議裡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">機架後側 26.565GHz 輻射超標，排查兩輪無果，最終靠一場無關會議上的論文找到解法：在連接器上加吸波材料。這不是玄學，是高頻物理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">EMC</span><span class=\"tag\">硬件工程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New Economics of AI | Martin Casado &amp; Steven Sinofsky Foom TAM in-distribution Mythical man-month expert systems\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-a16z-ai-正在把工程问题变成资本问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>AI 把軟件業從工程約束變成資本約束</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Martin Casado 與 Steven Sinofsky 的核心判斷：AI 把軟件業從工程約束變成資本約束——20 人的團隊也能有效花掉 10 億美元，創業公司因此能和巨頭同場競爭。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">資本</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Future of AI in the Workplace | Special Episode (Mike Sullivan and Vinay Gidwaney) work genome reducible / irreducible workforce intelligence score amplification score intelligence lock-in PIP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-rationalreminder-ai-时代该由-hr-主导-不是-it-把-ai-当员工雇进来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0b9befd958d3d16f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:30:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>AI 時代該由 HR 主導，不是 IT：把 AI 當員工僱進來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把 AI 當技術採購交給 IT，是把主菜當配菜；真正要拆的是任務而不是崗位，該主導這件事的是 HR，因為 AI 沒有感受，而人需要。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 落地</span><span class=\"tag\">組織變革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"495 陸大鵬談莎士比亞戲劇與英國歷史的互相影響 intertextuality\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-cn2aa250-莎士比亚历史剧是都铎王朝的宣传工具/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>莎士比亞歷史劇是都鐸王朝的宣傳工具</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">莎翁歷史劇歪曲史實極多，本質是都鐸王朝的政治宣傳：醜化理查三世、迴避亨利八世敏感話題，從而鞏固本朝合法性。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">莎士比亞</span><span class=\"tag\">英國歷史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"This Is Why People Hate the Government time tax ordeal mechanism improper payment only-once policy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-ezra-时间税-行政羞辱是穷人恨政府的原因/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>行政羞辱是窮人恨政府的原因：福利申請像一場時間稅</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">政府福利項目中的行政負擔不是效率問題，而是社會控制工具：它用羞辱和文書懲罰窮人，把進步政策變成篩選少數人的漏斗，最終讓受益者恨上政府。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">福利制度</span><span class=\"tag\">行政負擔</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Back by Popular Demand: How to support your child&#x27;s secure attachment even if you didn&#x27;t grow up with it with Dr. Miriam Steele Strange Situation Adult Attachment Interview reflective functioning good enough mother still face\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-secureattach-童年逆境不必传给孩子-会讲自己的故事就能打断代际循环/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">50:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>童年逆境不必傳給孩子：會講自己的故事就能打斷代際循環</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">倫敦親子項目發現，父母能否用連貫、靈活的方式講述自己的童年，比童年本身好壞更能預測孩子是否安全依戀——反思功能是可訓練的技能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">依戀理論</span><span class=\"tag\">養育</span>\n</div></div></a>"]